/mo><mn>10</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>We have the following circuit diagram.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-d9ebd0170706cf75cccf7f3b9442ef60\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/d9ebd0170706cf75cccf7f3b9442ef60\"></div>\n\n\n<p>The current <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"86\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> measured in amperes, is defined as the rate of flow of charge <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"87\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> measured in coulombs.\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"88\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"4\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Kirchhoff's voltage law states that in a series circuit, the source voltage (EMF) equals the sum of the voltage drops.</p>\n<p>In an RCL circuit, there are three voltage drops:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The voltage drop across the resistor is proportional to the current, with a constant of proportionality <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"89\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A9\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> So,\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"90\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D449 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.186em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>The voltage drop across the capacitor is related to its charge by <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"91\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D449 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.186em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> Therefore,\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"92\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D449 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.186em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"4\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"4\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mi>C</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mn>0.005</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>The voltage drop across the inductor is proportional to the rate of change of current, with a constant of proportionality <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"93\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c48\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" disp